        <div class="panel-head"><h2 id="h-why">Why programmes differ</h2><button class="hlink" type="button" data-drawer="differ">Method</button></div>
        <p class="cap" id="why-cap">Administration explains almost none of the differences between programmes in the poverty gap closed per dollar. What matters most is the share of benefits that reaches the poor, which depends on the country’s poverty level and on who receives the benefits. <a href="#explain" id="to-explain">How much each factor explains</a></p>
